mit_subject":"docs(effect): fix Effect v4 samples and add runtime notes (#2260)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:57Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"1337d18e660be2b2a34f9ca7ce176984bc2ce6ed","github_link":"https://github.com/TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia/commit/1337d18e660be2b2a34f9ca7ce176984bc2ce6ed","commit_subject":"Firearms hang on the back and the inventory is simpler. Three back slots (BACK_WEAPON_1..3) hold firearms - physical fixtures with their attachments, at 0.5x weight (0.15x with a backpack), drawn over the legs and under the torso, the one hidden last on top. Every firearm has a back_anchor in its .meta.json (a point on its sprite, rotated with it), following the layout of a few reference weapons. Bots' back weapons keep their mass but collide with nothing, so they don't snag on walls. A reload stops when its gun goes onto the back.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:44Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"cc03c6a61ad6a977e1e9c368cc4491962594229d","github_link":"https://github.com/TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia/commit/cc03c6a61ad6a977e1e9c368cc4491962594229d","commit_subject":"Everything hung on the back (backpack, bomb, defuse kit, weapons) sits closer to the body in the rifle (3 px), pistol (4 px) and heavy (1 px) stances, along the back's own axis - it was much further out than in the bare hands stance. Akimbo frames match the bare hands ones, which share the body sprite.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jirkapok/GasPlanner","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:44Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"24dddf910dadcf0f6b72baac399f3869c5518710","github_link":"https://github.com/jirkapok/GasPlanner/commit/24dddf910dadcf0f6b72baac399f3869c5518710","commit_subject":"refactor: #106 calculate computer data by scuba-physics","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"utopia-php/database","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:38Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1945a6abe11876f936f13ddf503f1e5cee58c728","github_link":"https://github.com/utopia-php/database/commit/1945a6abe11876f936f13ddf503f1e5cee58c728","commit_subject":"fix(join): label an over-long joined column by a digest of its label","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"loro-dev/loro","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:37Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"089a4e64731cf1609d8b6918b93a151f2b8db26a","github_link":"https://github.com/loro-dev/loro/commit/089a4e64731cf1609d8b6918b93a151f2b8db26a","commit_subject":"fix: keep parsed blocks out of doc-wide arenas and contain callback panics (#1197)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:36Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"f2ac543613c8eed50d89a9349f0fcc816e9f28f7","github_link":"https://github.com/TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia/commit/f2ac543613c8eed50d89a9349f0fcc816e9f28f7","commit_subject":"The gold star of the favorite servers before \"Original Hypersomnia\" next to the game speed sliders, instead of \"*\".","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:31Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"6b429736a39961564ffd472bff9774e0c1c0d16c","github_link":"https://github.com/TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia/commit/6b429736a39961564ffd472bff9774e0c1c0d16c","commit_subject":"Awka's bullets fly at 16000 px/s instead of 12000, faster than the Hunter's. Box2D slowed every body down to 2 m (200 px) per step - 12000 px/s at 60 Hz - so now a body has its own limit (b2BodyDef::maxTranslation): missiles get 5 m (b2_maxMissileTranslation), enough for up to 18000 px/s at 1.5x bullet speed, and everything else moves exactly as before. Bullets at bullet speeds above 1x are no longer silently capped at 12000 px/s either.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"truenas/webui","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:36:24Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"ef87eef5861376bee4961822c89121e0434f1c23","github_link":"https://github.com/truenas/w